      "requirement": "An owner acting in good faith may terminate a tenancy to recover possession to occupy the property for the owner or their qualified relative for a minimum of 12 continuous months as a primary residence. For leases entered into on or after June 24, 2023, this applies only if the tenant agrees in writing or the lease expressly allows it; it does not apply if the intended occupant already occupies a unit on the property or a vacancy of a similar unit already exists.",
