      "requirement": "A written notice terminating tenancy for demolition or substantial remodel must be certified under penalty of perjury and include an intent statement, mandatory re-rental offer language, work description and expected duration or demolition date, copies of permits (or signed hazardous abatement contract if no permit needed), and an explanation of why the work requires vacating for at least 30 continuous days.",
